# Atomic-write tmp files. fetch_ad_data.py and
# categorize_creative.py both write to <name>.tmp then rename. A
# crash mid-write leaves the orphan tmp on disk; without this rule
# the daily-data / creative-intelligence commit steps would
# `git add` it.
*.json.tmp
